Package: libva-v4l2
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: VA-API backend for Qualcomm Iris stateful V4L2 M2M
 VA-API backend for Qualcomm Iris using the Linux V4L2 stateful M2M
 interface. It provides hardware video decoding and H.264/HEVC encoding
 on SC8280XP, tested on Radxa Dragon Q8B. The project is experimental
 and targets this platform; it is not a generic backend for all V4L2
 devices.
